        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>准爸爸备忘录</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: {\n        inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n        displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n      }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100%;\n      background: #ffffff;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Noto Sans SC\", \"PingFang SC\", SimHei, sans-serif;\n      color: #111111;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 722px;\n      flex: 0 0 540px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      border: 5px solid #287f24;\n    }\n\n    .inner {\n      position: absolute;\n      inset: 0;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 14px;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 100%;\n      margin: 0;\n      color: #050505;\n      font-size: 39px;\n      font-weight: 900;\n      line-height: 52px;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .section-title {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 40px;\n      color: #f01814;\n      font-size: 29px;\n      font-weight: 900;\n      font-style: italic;\n      line-height: 38px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .section-title .swash {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 0;\n      left: 50%;\n      bottom: 5px;\n      width: 120px;\n      height: 11px;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n      background: #f8b72c;\n      clip-path: polygon(\n        0 48%, 8% 28%, 24% 24%, 37% 10%, 58% 22%,\n        76% 14%, 89% 30%, 100% 48%, 91% 66%, 74% 70%,\n        60% 88%, 37% 75%, 18% 82%, 6% 65%\n      );\n    }\n\n    .section-title .label {\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n    }\n\n    .month-three {\n      top: 84px;\n    }\n\n    .month-four {\n      top: 356px;\n    }\n\n    .text-block {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 16px;\n      right: 10px;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      font-size: 17.2px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      line-height: 21.35px;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n\n    .text-block.first {\n      top: 132px;\n    }\n\n    .text-block.second {\n      top: 407px;\n    }\n\n    .item {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    .line {\n      display: block;\n      height: 21.35px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .square {\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      font-weight: 900;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"inner\">\n      <h1>准爸爸备忘录</h1>\n\n      <div class=\"section-title month-three\">\n        <span class=\"swash\"></span>\n        <span class=\"label\">孕3月</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <section class=\"text-block first\">\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <span class=\"line\"><span class=\"square\">■</span>1、孕早期油烟味容易刺激孕吐，所以做饭准爸爸也包了吧。</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <span class=\"line\"><span class=\"square\">■</span>2、增大的子宫开始压迫膀胱，出现尿频，总有排不净尿的感觉。</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">提醒孕妈千万不要刻意不喝水或憋尿，免得造成尿路感染。</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <span class=\"line\"><span class=\"square\">■</span>3、给孕妈准备好妊娠油，缓解妊娠纹的增长，虽然长不长纹主要看</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">体质，但是涂了能减轻点。</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <span class=\"line\"><span class=\"square\">■</span>4、如果孕妈肚子上长了妊娠纹，要多沟通安抚她的情绪、赞美她</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">，因为肚子上布满青紫色的纹路，会让妈妈变得很沮丧或不自信。</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <span class=\"line\"><span class=\"square\">■</span>5、本月重点产检：孕12周去医院建档(需空腹),提前查好需要准</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">备什么材料，替孕妈做足准备，带上水和零食（重要产检事项可参</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">考我之前的笔记）</span>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"section-title month-four\">\n        <span class=\"swash\"></span>\n        <span class=\"label\">孕4月</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <section class=\"text-block second\">\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <span class=\"line\"><span class=\"square\">■</span>1、很多孕妈在孕4个半月就开始感觉到胎动，胎动是了解胎儿在</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">宫内情况的最好方法，记得提醒孕妈多关注胎动情况。</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <span class=\"line\"><span class=\"square\">■</span>2、孕4个月开始要补充钙剂和铁剂，钙剂提醒孕妈睡前吃，最好</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">吃带有维D成分的钙剂，更好吸收。铁剂晚上7-8点吃，同时补充维</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">生素C，有利于铁剂的吸收。</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <span class=\"line\"><span class=\"square\">■</span>3、孕4个月后孕吐减轻，食欲好转。这时候体重增长变快，提醒</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">孕妈控制体重，少食多餐，少油少盐少糖，多吃粗粮。</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <span class=\"line\"><span class=\"square\">■</span>4、抽空陪孕妈散步、孕期瑜伽、聊天，帮助孕妈放松心情。提醒</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">孕妈不要久坐、久躺，预防水肿。</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <span class=\"line\"><span class=\"square\">■</span>5、外出坐车时，准爸爸可以给孕妈准备专门的孕妇安全带，这样</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">坐车如果急刹车，不会勒肚子和腿，保护孕妈和胎儿</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <span class=\"line\"><span class=\"square\">■</span>6、本月重点产检：孕16周唐筛或无创，无创会更检测得精准点但</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">小贵(一般无需空腹和憋尿)</span>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
